Adapted from soniqo/speech-swift, Apache-2.0.
https://github.com/soniqo/speech-swift
Upstream revision: 31d676c6a7f1a3f9e3004c06914de54e61f0f987

Modified for a local-only runtime: removed AudioCommon, remote downloads,
logging, protocol and memory extensions; added a local model loader.
Fixed Japanese phonemizer gap slicing to use UTF-16 NSRange consistently.

Base Kokoro model: hexgrad/Kokoro-82M, Apache-2.0.
https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
CoreML conversion: aufklarer/Kokoro-82M-CoreML-INT8, Apache-2.0.
Model revision: 4ef656f55554ceb242ed11febbdbbffd60dd5938

Retain the third-party attribution comments in the adapted source files.
This package does not redistribute model weights. Additional changes: actor-owned
model access, typed asset and inference errors, cancellation between predictions,
canonical Japanese text normalization, and bounded text requests.

Pronunciation resources and embedded dictionaries
-----------------------------------------------
Sources/NeuralVoices/Resources/dict_fr.json, dict_pt.json, and dict_hi.json,
and the Spanish/Italian literals in PronunciationDicts.swift, were retained
from the pinned speech-swift source. Its source attribution names
open-dict-data/ipa-dict (MIT) and standard phonetic references.
https://github.com/open-dict-data/ipa-dict
Reference license revision: 972cd67dd5f96bc5660e28070cde26e3928abcd7
Copyright (c) 2016 dohliam. Full text: ThirdPartyNotices/ipa-dict-MIT.txt.
Third-party datasets in ipa-dict retain their own licenses; this package
does not bundle ipa-dict's Japanese, Mandarin, German, Korean, Finnish,
British English, or other separate datasets. The English dictionaries and
G2P models are not bundled here; the app's verified model manifest owns them.

